  "//geometry": [
    "An arena, not a maze. Everything is one sightline and the pacing comes from",
    "the cages, not from doors:",
    "",
    "  R0  antechamber   x  6..20  z 44..56  y8..14   (spawn)",
    "  S1  secret cache  x  1.. 4  z 47..53            behind a fake wall at x 5",
    "  C0  throat        x 21..28  z 48..52  y8..12",
    "  AR  the furnace   x 29..86  z 14..82  y8..24",
    "        two lava trenches at z 35..37 and z 59..61, each with two metal bridges",
    "        six obsidian pillars, and a hellstone dais at x 54..62 z 44..52 rising",
    "        to y10 with a stair on its west face",
    "  RK  RED keycard   on the dais at 58.5, 11.1, 48.5",
    "  CG-A cage north-west  x 30..40  z  4..12   door d-cage-a at z13",
    "  CG-B cage north-east  x 44..56  z  4..12   door d-cage-b at z13",
    "  CG-C cage east        x 88..93  z 30..44   door d-cage-c at x87",
    "  CG-D cage south       x 30..44  z 84..92   door d-cage-d at z83",
    "  SW1 gauntlet switch on the north-west pillar -> opens cages A and B",
    "  SW2 gauntlet switch on the south-east pillar -> opens cages C and D",
    "  D1  RED DOOR      x 71..73  z 13    y8..11",
    "  ER  exit vault    x 60..86  z  4..12  y8..16   exit + exit switch",
    "  S2  secret vault  x 88..92  z  5..11            behind a fake wall at x 87",
    "",
    "The cages hold the ammunition. You do not have enough without them, which is",
    "the whole trade: open a cage, take what is in it, fight what came out of it."
  ],

